.SH "NAME"
vscope \- VScope Data Acquisition Software
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
\fBvscope\fR
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
The \fBvscope\fR(1) command starts the VScope Data Acquisition system\&.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.sp
None\&.
.SH "BUGS"
.sp
VScope has been used daily in our lab for 15 years now\&. Some bugs remain\&. Please contact the author if one bites you\&.
